#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-Dense.md:186
msgid "5.1 Single-Node Online Deployment"
msgstr "5.1 单节点在线部署"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-Dense.md:188
msgid ""
"Single-node deployment completes both Prefill and Decode within the same "
"node. `Qwen3.5-2B`, `Qwen3.5-4B`, and `Qwen3.5-9B` can be deployed on Atlas "
"300I DUO or Atlas 200I Pro."
msgstr ""
"单节点部署在同一节点内完成 Prefill 和 Decode。`Qwen3.5-2B`、`Qwen3.5-4B` 和 `Qwen3.5-9B` "
"可以部署在 Atlas 300I DUO 或 Atlas 200I Pro 上。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-Dense.md:190
msgid ""
"**Parallelism note**: These platforms currently support the **TP** scenario."
" Choose **TP=1** or **TP=2** according to the available devices. On Atlas "
"200I Pro with a single visible NPU, use **TP=1**."
msgstr ""
"**并行说明**：这些平台目前支持 **TP** 场景。根据可用设备选择 **TP=1** 或 **TP=2**。在单个可见 NPU 的 Atlas "
"200I Pro 上，使用 **TP=1**。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-Dense.md:192
msgid ""
"The following examples use FP16 weights from ModelScope. Replace "
"`MODEL_PATH` with your local directory if needed."
msgstr "以下示例使用 ModelScope 的 FP16 权重。如果需要，请将 `MODEL_PATH` 替换为您的本地目录。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-Dense.md:198
#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-Dense.md:228
#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-Dense.md:258
msgid "Startup Command:"
msgstr "启动命令："

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-Dense.md:287
msgid "Key Parameter Descriptions:"
msgstr "关键参数说明："

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-Dense.md:289
msgid ""
"`--tensor-parallel-size` sets the tensor parallel size. Prefer **TP=1** on "
"Atlas 200I Pro. On Atlas 300I DUO, **TP=1** and **TP=2** are both supported;"
" choose according to the available devices."
msgstr ""
"`--tensor-parallel-size` 设置张量并行大小。在 Atlas 200I Pro 上优先使用 **TP=1**。在 Atlas "
"300I DUO 上，**TP=1** 和 **TP=2** 均受支持；请根据可用设备进行选择。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-Dense.md:290
msgid ""
"`--max-model-len` represents the context length (input plus output for a "
"single request). On Atlas 300I DUO and Atlas 200I Pro, configure this value "
"according to the actual device memory; setting it too high may cause OOM."
msgstr ""
"`--max-model-len` 表示上下文长度（单个请求的输入加输出）。在 Atlas 300I DUO 和 Atlas 200I Pro "
"上，请根据实际设备内存配置该值；设置过高可能导致 OOM。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-Dense.md:291
msgid ""
"`--max-num-seqs` indicates the maximum number of requests that can be "
"processed concurrently. On Atlas 300I DUO and Atlas 200I Pro, configure this"
" value according to the actual device memory; setting it too high may cause "
"OOM."
msgstr ""
"`--max-num-seqs` 表示可以并发处理的最大请求数。在 Atlas 300I DUO 和 Atlas 200I Pro "
"上，请根据实际设备内存配置该值；设置过高可能导致 OOM。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-Dense.md:292
msgid ""
"`--gpu-memory-utilization` represents the proportion of HBM that vLLM will "
"use for actual inference. On Atlas 300I DUO and Atlas 200I Pro, configure "
"this value according to the actual device memory; setting it too high may "
"cause OOM. The default value is `0.9`."
msgstr ""
"`--gpu-memory-utilization` 表示 vLLM 将用于实际推理的 HBM 比例。在 Atlas 300I DUO 和 Atlas "
"200I Pro 上，请根据实际设备内存配置该值；设置过高可能导致 OOM。默认值为 `0.9`。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-Dense.md:293
msgid ""
"`--dtype float16` must be set on Atlas 300I DUO and Atlas 200I Pro. These "
"devices only support the FP16 data type."
msgstr ""
"在 Atlas 300I DUO 和 Atlas 200I Pro 上必须设置 `--dtype float16`。这些设备仅支持 FP16 数据类型。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-Dense.md:294
msgid ""
"`--mamba-ssm-cache-dtype` sets the data type of the Mamba SSM cache. On "
"Atlas 300I DUO and Atlas 200I Pro, only `float16` is supported."
msgstr ""
"`--mamba-ssm-cache-dtype` 设置 Mamba SSM 缓存的数据类型。在 Atlas 300I DUO 和 Atlas 200I"
" Pro 上，仅支持 `float16`。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-Dense.md:295
msgid ""
"`--speculative-config` uses `qwen3_5_mtp` for Qwen3.5 Dense models that "
"include an MTP head. It is recommended to set `num_speculative_tokens` to "
"`1`."
msgstr ""
"`--speculative-config`对包含MTP头的Qwen3.5 "
"Dense模型使用`qwen3_5_mtp`。建议将`num_speculative_tokens`设置为`1`。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-Dense.md:296
msgid ""
"`--compilation-config` contains configurations related to the aclgraph graph"
" mode:"
msgstr "`--compilation-config`包含与aclgraph图模式相关的配置："

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-Dense.md:297
msgid "`\"cudagraph_mode\"`: `\"FULL_DECODE_ONLY\"` is recommended."
msgstr "`\"cudagraph_mode\"`：建议使用`\"FULL_DECODE_ONLY\"`。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-Dense.md:298
msgid ""
"`\"cudagraph_capture_sizes\"`: when tensor parallelism (TP) is enabled, "
"hardware event-id constraints allow at most two capture sizes (for example, "
"`[1, 8]`). With MTP enabled, calculate each capture size as `n * "
"(num_speculative_tokens + 1)`, where `n` is a capture size for the "
"deployment without MTP. For example, when `num_speculative_tokens` is `1`, "
"the non-MTP sizes `[1,2,4,8]` become `[2,4,8,16]`."
msgstr ""
"`\"cudagraph_capture_sizes\"`：当启用张量并行（TP）时，硬件事件 ID 限制最多允许两个捕获大小（例如 `[1, "
"8]`）。启用 MTP 后，每个捕获大小按 `n * (num_speculative_tokens + 1)` 计算，其中 `n` 是未启用 MTP "
"时的捕获大小。例如，当 `num_speculative_tokens` 为 `1` 时，非 MTP 的大小 `[1,2,4,8]` 变为 "
"`[2,4,8,16]`。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-Dense.md:299
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`--additional-config` with `\"ascend_compilation_config\": "
"{\"enable_npugraph_ex\": false}` is required because `enable_npugraph_ex` is"
" not supported on these platforms."
msgstr ""
"需要使用包含`\"ascend_compilation_config\": {\"enable_npugraph_ex\": "
"false}`的`--additional-config`，因为这些平台不支持`enable_npugraph_ex`。"

